      "description": "<The fact that you found only one body is a hopeful sign. Perhaps the High Elf that Trevan and Hadrec described is still alive somewhere deeper inside the nearby fortress?>",
      "summary": "Investigate Fenris Keep to the north and attempt to locate the missing member of the Earthen Ring party.",
      "title": "Into Fenris Keep",
